  "vendor": "Aventon",
  "productType": "eBike",
  "descriptionHtml": "<div data-page-id=\"L3fBdXF24oXqklxdz2Wc1fKKnbb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line text-indent ace-line old-record-id-Uc7sdV4ktoWO7hxNLiUcFgwGnMc\">Designed in the spirit of simplicity, the Soltera 3 ADV is built to explore city streets with minimal upkeep. Outfitted with a low-maintenance Gates Carbon Belt Drive, torque sensor, and hydraulic disc brakes, the Soltera 3 ADV blends intuitive performance with practical design. Its single-speed configuration nods to Aventon’s roots, while maintaining a lightweight build made for urban agility. Paired with responsive geometry, the Soltera 3 ADV is your ultimate companion for commutes, quick trips, and urban explorations.</div>\n</div><h2>Buying your Aventon from Quest Watersports</h2><ul><li>Every e-bike purchased through Quest Watersports includes a <strong>$160 assembly and tuning fee</strong>.</li><li>Colors and sizes we don't have in stock can be special ordered. Call 815.433.2200 or request info below.</li><li>Financing is available through Synchrony, subject to credit approval.</li></ul>",
